# Force LF line endings for all text files. Several on-disk resources and
# test fixtures are validated by byte-exact SHA-256 hashes (institution
# bundle manifests, knowledge corpus/index metadata, project contentRefs).
# On Windows, core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite LF -> CRLF on checkout
# and break every hash check, making the institution profile and the test
# fixtures fail to load. This repository tracks no binary files.
* text eol=lf
